	(text "POWER: USB-C (5.1k CC pull-downs) -> U1 MCP73831 charges the LiPo at 100 mA (R3 10k).\nVBAT (3.0-4.2 V) feeds U2 AP2112K-3.3 (always on), the motor and the glow LED.\nVBAT_SENSE = VBAT / 2 -> IO0 (ADC). CHG_STAT -> IO1 (low while charging)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e4c4ed5f-44af-52c7-9360-1839f8a95620")
	)
	(text "MCU: ESP32-C6-MINI-1, antenna on a board edge with copper kept clear. Native USB on IO12/IO13\n(flash over USB-C, no buttons). IO2 MOT_PWM, IO3 BTN (LP GPIO: wakes from deep sleep),\nIO6 glow LED, IO7 link LED. IO8 pulled high (R7); IO9 internal pull-up, TP1 pulls it low for recovery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "08ed13b3-a5ba-5242-a42f-8e86e4435205")
	)
	(text "AWAKE: side tact switch to GND, internal pull-up. Press = 'I'm up', stops the buzz and tells the sensor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9e93ed16-ee7f-5e51-8f6c-c75e158d2b7d")
	)
	(text "HAPTIC: ERM coin motor (10 x 2.7 mm, 3 V) on VBAT, Q1 low side, PWM ~20 kHz from IO2.\nThree levels = 3 duty cycles; firmware caps duty at ~70 % at full battery (motor is 3 V rated).\nGLOW: WS2812B-2020 on VBAT (works to ~3.5 V); link LED green 0603 on IO7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 203.2 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29dcf2d6-4052-5f01-aa95-b8f448d1f91b")
	)
